# Database & Eloquent Rules

## Database

- Default: SQLite (configurable via `DB_CONNECTION` env)
- Testing: SQLite in-memory (`:memory:`)
- Production-ready for PostgreSQL or MySQL

## Migrations

### Naming Convention
- `YYYY_MM_DD_HHMMSS_description.php` (Laravel default)
- Use descriptive names: `create_items_table`, `add_story_points_to_items`, `create_bookmark_collaborators_table`

### Required Fields for Main Entities
```php
$table->id();
$table->uuid('uuid')->unique();
$table->string('name');
$table->string('slug')->unique();  // where applicable
$table->timestamps();
$table->softDeletes();             // on main entities
```

### Foreign Keys
```php
$table->foreignId('workspace_id')->constrained()->cascadeOnDelete();
$table->foreignId('user_id')->constrained()->cascadeOnDelete();
```

### JSON Fields
```php
$table->json('settings')->nullable();
$table->json('metadata')->nullable();
```

## Eloquent Patterns

### Eager Loading — Always eager load to avoid N+1
```php
// Controller
$board->load(['columns.items.labels', 'columns.items.assignee']);

// Query
Board::with(['columns' => function ($q) {
    $q->orderBy('position');
}])->findOrFail($id);
```

### Scoped Queries
```php
// Always scope to user's accessible workspaces
$workspaces = $user->workspaces()->with('projects')->get();
```

### Mass Assignment
- Always use `$fillable` — never `$guarded = []`
- Use `create()` / `update()` with validated data

### Relationships Reference

| Parent | Child | Type |
|---|---|---|
| User | Workspaces | BelongsToMany (pivot: role) |
| Workspace | Projects | HasMany |
| Workspace | Bookmarks | HasMany |
| Project | Boards | HasMany |
| Project | Pages | HasMany |
| Project | Labels | HasMany |
| Board | Columns | HasMany |
| Board | Items | HasMany |
| BoardColumn | Items | HasMany |
| Item | Comments | HasMany |
| Item | Attachments | HasMany |
| Item | Labels | BelongsToMany |
| Item | Links | HasMany (outgoing/incoming) |
| Page | Children | HasMany (self-referential tree) |
| Bookmark | Items | HasMany |
| Bookmark | Collaborators | BelongsToMany |
